oefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186241007 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2ac0eba6-63cf-51a7-bd8d-7c6c4966ac54" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -5 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238432} {:answer/id #uuid "39a212d1-af7d-5c19-abae-50bcab624e33" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -4 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 0\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238552} {:answer/id #uuid "cb7ce99a-cfc4-5233-9022-cc905af6f444" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239838} {:answer/id #uuid "f64d2597-0209-5cbb-aff6-059615bc1116" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240226} {:answer/id #uuid "fe4e9051-5ef8-5ac9-9a08-88030f7c035c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & 3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 4\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cb7ce99a-cfc4-5233-9022-cc905af6f444" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239838} :answer-field/id #uuid "550550c8-9dd4-595d-b065-7a3b3268d8df" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240487}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "51bc932c-31ca-5427-ac34-1e2bfeba299b" :question/math-academy-id "q-1052" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix 