[\\begin{array}{cc|c}23 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510643} {:answer/id #uuid "d3d5b67b-3067-53e7-8bf6-98af6b8a2267" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}23 & 1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 0 & 19\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510677}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2c8050c5-a8f1-55cb-bf44-7edb50ce94da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}23 & 1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 19\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510640} :answer-field/id #uuid "185ed767-72df-58ef-a1c6-1ef13cfa3cbf" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510636}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "afea0964-cf32-5182-a423-aaa886aaa39e" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\\begin{cases}23x+y+z=8 \\\\ x+z=19\\end{cases}$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\\begin{cases}23x+y+z=8 \\\\ x+0y+z=19\\end{cases}$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}23 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}23 & 1 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 19\\end{array}\\right]\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510675 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f98d3f2-bc3d-52e1-8dcc-fa5a0219067b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}8 & -16 & 23 \\\\ 10 & 1 & 19\\end{array}\\right]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510635} {:answer/id 